text = "• [W / A / S / D]  Move Character
• [LMB / J]  3-Hit Rapier Combo (Dash-Cancelable)
• [RMB / K]  Defensive Parry (Breaks Enemy Posture)
• [SPACE / SHIFT]  Cellular Dash (ZZZ Perfect Dodge)
• [C]  Toggle Camera POV (Hades 45° vs MLBB Tactical MOBA)

STAGE OBJECTIVES:
1. Purge all 12 Hostiles
2. Die no more than 1 time
3. Die no more than 2 times
(Stage ends in Defeat if character dies 3 times!)"

